return {
    ["        也许是陌生的敌人？我这一生见过无数的敌人，经历过无数的危险，面对过无数的疯狂……"] = "        Perhaps an unfamiliar enemy? I have seen countless enemies in my life, experienced countless dangers, and faced countless madnesses...",
    [" 眼前的景象骤然扭曲、模糊，像是信号受到干扰，又像是有人刻意抹去了后面的内容。"] = "The scene before my eyes suddenly twisted and blurred, as if the signal were being interfered with, or as if someone had deliberately erased the content that followed.",
    ["%s:\n      我听闻你与子爵夫人遭遇了一场苦战。不必过分担忧。在过去的岁月循环中，我已经明白失败与胜利——乃至生存与死亡——都不过是一时的、相对的：它只是你旅途中的一个普通坐标，用来验证你的成长。谨记面对子爵夫人的诀窍：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302120\">子爵夫人的记载</>\n      对于一位总在路上的旅人来说，我知道让人停下脚步的常常并非挫折本身，而是失去了再次上路的勇气。所幸你并不胆怯于面对更多新冒险，我想下次，我听到的就会是更好的消息。对你这样年轻的非凡者而言，你已经做得很好。\n      如果你需要的话，漫长的时光为我积淀下一些经验，也许对你有用。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看</>"] = "%s:\n      I heard that you encountered a bitter battle with the Viscountess. Do not worry too much. In the cycles of time past, I have come to understand that failure and victory—and even life and death—are merely temporary and relative: they are just ordinary coordinates on your journey, used to verify your growth. Keep in mind the tips for facing the Viscountess: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302120\">Records of the Viscountess</>\n      For a traveler who is always on the road, I know that what makes people stop is often not the setback itself, but the loss of courage to set off again. Fortunately, you are not timid about facing new adventures, and I think next time, the news I hear will be better. For a young Beyonder like you, you have already done very well. \n      If you need it, the long passage of time has accumulated some experience for me that might be useful to you. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view</>",
    ["%s解锁自动分解。"] = "%s automatic decomposition unlocked.",
